## Results compared

Both are the same bed (EnhA, nc_EnhA.bed), the same SFS, the same demography
(three_epoch, Na = 18219.79858004048, theta = 187614.67958247045) and the same cache;
they differ only in the integration method in force when the DFE was fit.

