integration_test_EnhA.docx         the write-up

As in Fig. 2A, the last class combines 0.01 <= |s| < 0.5 with 0.5 <= |s| < inf.

## Result

Largest absolute difference in any |s| class: 7.41e-04 (neutral class, 0.9100 vs 0.9093).
Delta log-likelihood: 0.0224, quad the higher.

## Scope of the comparison

One annotation (EnhA), one pdf (neugamma). No post-patch gamma fit with a summary
exists for EnhA, so gamma could not be compared the same way; the patch was written
for neugamma and extended to gamma three days later.

Census of all 333 neugamma result directories under $RD, by the date of their newest
*.InferDFE.bestfits: exactly one falls inside the 2025-03-22 to 2025-04-02 window in
which the patch was active. Every other published neugamma result was produced with
stock quad.
